++1. Thumbs up/down states disappearing after DOM morphs: Extracted internal React Fiber UUIDs into data-message-id to bridge client-side window.tappedThumbs tracking with the server snapshot.
++2. ChatGPT DOM structure changes: Updated app_v8.js DOM traversal query to accommodate sibling action buttons instead of nested ones.
++3. Double activation conflicts: Removed legacy DOM reading rules from server.js CSS injected payload, making the UI blue state strictly driven by client-side .active-thumb classes.
